---
permalink: /en/galeria/
title: "Gallery & videos"
description: "Real photos and videos of the Palomino Islands voyage: sea lions, the yacht and the route. Includes reports by CNN and El Tour de los Incas."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span> Gallery</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Gallery</p>
    <h1>The experience, in real images</h1>
    <p class="lead">We only use authentic photos and videos from our voyages. Click any photo to enlarge it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Photos</p>
    <h2>Moments from the voyage</h2>
    <div class="gallery-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      {% for n in [1,2,3,4,5,6,7] %}
      <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/galeria/g{{ n }}.jpg" alt="Guests swimming with sea lions and the wildlife of the Palomino Islands" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--radius);display:block">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Marine wildlife</p>
    <h2>The wildlife of the Palomino Islands</h2>
    <p class="lead">Seabirds, sea lions and other species of Peru's cold sea that you'll see on the voyage. Tap any card to enlarge it.</p>
    <div class="fauna-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      {% for n in range(1, 51) %}
      <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/fauna/f{{ n }}.jpg" alt="Palomino Islands marine wildlife card" loading="lazy">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">In the media</p>
    <h2>Reports about Ecocruceros</h2>

    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6);align-items:start">
      <div>
        <div class="embed">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ site.video.incas }}" title="Report — El Tour de los Incas" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="embed-caption">Report by the YouTube channel <strong>{{ site.video.incasChannel }}</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="embed">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ site.video.cnn }}" title="CNN report (2006)" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="embed-caption">Our work, featured in a <strong>CNN</strong> report (2006).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <p>See more on our YouTube channel: <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@ecocruceros8644</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
